    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0eaab72210af71549450c1b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无妨。这也是对圣女的考验。\n区区凡水，可扑不灭神圣的赤红之炎。",
      "source_fingerprint": "221ce6e1a71432de7e82a9be82347449cb1a4bbc71b3114c73f5d20c5f999c0f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136001.json",
      "json_path": [
