      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16cd1f6caeea3e1983b6ba8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "又过了几天，红色梦想参加了一场模拟赛。\n而人气极高的瞩目新星也参与了那场比赛……",
      "source_fingerprint": "49aa922913202603c540200a4d4bd85afb953e50db7b4cf412b2852257dac619",
