    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80ecdff47f147e4b73fe6d8b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀，获胜的肯定是那孩子吧。根本不是一个级别的。\n果然有着特别的气场呢！呜呜，不知道能不能跟得上？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a668993b4bbc09bab34834155c0e8cfb8fc72e8742310b92ef1bb5c05d659d8e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
