      "uid": "zhcn:2b32fe7d4c166470e1d100ab",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……在发生这样的事的某天放学后。\n我一边看着正刻苦训练的赛马娘们，一边有些出神地想着。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bde467d6a07af79a214130e455a623d61311b4fa4195df3b553f919bdeca26cd",
