      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62835bb785c6a7fa6c898e04",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "顶住了迷人景致那惊人冲刺的红色梦想。\n她的奔跑展现出了扎实的实力，并隐约散发着神圣的光芒——",
      "source_fingerprint": "f1a3f8bb35a3c4cedfc8c8f092d8ad7e7dd223e73c340adcda331aab8c7735d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        37,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/37/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be5ab379b5e3e6b875e8c4a9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛马娘们",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0f0dcd5cfbde045bcedbcf0687c7f95f475ee6315345fa057f54916adbdac32",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:934bd0ca4a41b600ffc9d51b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不愧是景致酱！我就知道她会赢！\n果然，她就是个天才呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9728d97e17458a8557cca186395c5a75fe889e386bda72b559b3f893604388f1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ae7b6387f7225e4c2b1f62b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——然而，她终究没能赢下胜利。\n四周充斥着对迷人景致的赞美之声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a30c1c33688df1db7fd2710e38dce94060212eb0d78ea17e4aa1c73f5bab15a3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e236a210d710b6d17012a98",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "自己怎么看都不够起眼，实力也还差得远。\n在这种情况下，想要拥有担当赛马娘还是太早了吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "147c6987fd786a1178d2d413c19a2ca0effa122735ae4f893bb56db9dd91894b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
