      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但我知道……\n所谓的考验，只会降临在有能力克服它的人身上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba49aa818a2e44553e00047bde4353575d1652a773c9e2f59feafe8e1663af7e",
