    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2e3c52c0233821dea81df885",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——哪怕夜色已深，那双眼眸依然在我脑海中挥之不去。\n她虽然说着『因为我是圣女』而毫不气馁，不过……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a1807b7e99e09f790da0ffaff767c12de2f5992928d6fe79cc4dfef9df54493",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136001.json",
      "json_path": [
