      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e3379bd4c537848db8c289e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "『自己是特别的』那种青春期特有的感觉……\n总觉得既有些怀念，又让人有些难为情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b52b42e10c4c193d0e610a2ab732b1c2f96412575616bdc909d91d45c55f3310",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1136/storytimeline_041136001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        46,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/46/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8a401db98e2704cceee18f0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过，也正是因为有这份信念，她才能那样拼命吧。\n……真是有趣的孩子。我想着，以后要是有机会的话，就找她聊聊吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "908baebfee31ceb8390af4d41404057741d80eeb10206a2ffbed9b529b87f6cf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
